&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with internal teams and customers on high-priority escalations and act as a resource to resolve escalations from team members as necessary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
